corresponding products 6. Compound 6{19} The product was obtained as a
pale yellow oil (81% yield). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 1.78-1.86 (m, 4H),
2.63-2.68 (m, 4H), 2.95 (t, J = 5.7 Hz, 2H), 3.779 (s, 3H), 3.780 (s,
3H), 4.16 (t, J = 5.7 Hz, 2H), 6.78 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 2H), 6.93-7.03 (m,
4H), 7.20-7.25 (m, 4H), 7.70 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 1H); 13C NMR (100 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 23.7 (×2), 55.0 (×2), 55.35, 55.38, 55.7, 67.2, 105.8, 114.0
(×2), 114.3, 115.0 (×2), 122.8, 127.1, 128.2, 130.8 (×2), 131.0, 131.6
(×2), 132.0, 140.6, 142.4, 157.8, 158.3, 159.2; HRMS calcd for C28H29NO3S
[M+], 459.1868, found 459.1876.
