$DATUM green chemistry-reagent, Selection of appropriate fluorous reagents and
extraction solvents makes that crude products from a fluorous Mitsunobu
reaction can be separated from reagents by direct liquid-liquid
extraction., fluorous Mitsunobu reaction, fluorous reagents
products,fluorous diethyl carbohydrazide and fluorous triphenylphosphine
oxide,can be recovered in about 75-80% for recycle by conversion back to
the starting reagents., work-up
