$DATUM cis-Adamantane-2-spiro-3'-8'-[4-(2-phthalimidoethoxy)-phenyl]-1',2',4'-trioxaspiro[4.5]decane
(22). To a solution of 5 (1.07 g, 3 mmol), triphenylphosphine (1.26 g,
4.8 mmol), N-(2-hydroxyethy1)phthalimide (0.86 g, 4.5 mmol), and Et3N
(0.49 g, 4.8 mmol) in THF (20 ml) at 0°C was added dropwise diisopropyl
azodicarboxylate (0.98 g, 4.8 rnrnol). The mixture was stirred at rt
overnight and concentrated. The residue was triturated with ethanol (45
ml) to afford 22, yield 1.20 g, 80%, as a colorless solid. mp 142-144
°C;1H NMR (CDCl3)δ 1.62-2.02 (m, 22H), 2.43-2.48 (m, 1H), 4.09 (t, J= 5.9
Hz, 2H), 4.20 (t, J= 5.9 Hz, 2H), 6.80 (d, J=8.3 Hz, 2H), 7.07 (d, J=8.3
Hz, 2H), 7.7 1-7.73 (m, 2H), 7.84-7.86 (m, 2H). 13C NMR
(CDCl3)δ26.5,26.9,31.6,34.7, 34.8, 36.4, 36.8, 37.4,42.0, 64.7, 108.4,
111.3, 114.5, 123.3, 132.0, 134.0, 138.8, 156.7, 168.1. Anal. Calcd for
C32H35NO6C: , 72.57; H, 6.66; N, 2.64. Found: C, 72.39; H,6.40; N, 2.60.
